OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for cafe near monument
OL,4,Arevived
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans for a cafe at the
OL,7,Ffoot of a historic landmark have been
OL,8,Frevived.
OL,10,FProposals for the site at the bottom of
OL,11,FPenshaw Hill, near Sunderland, were
OL,12,Frefused in March.
OL,14,FIt followed a number of objections,
OL,15,Fincluding from the National Trust, with
OL,16,Fconcerns raised about the "impact on
OL,17,Fthe setting" of Penshaw Monument and
OL,18,F"the potential for unacceptable
OL,19,Fecological, landscape and traffic
OL,20,Fimpacts".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
